GLOBAL_ENTRY_POINT
[Start]
   ↓
Check Kill Switch (system_enabled)
   ↓
If OFF → Exit immediately
   ↓
Check Circuit Breaker (OPEN / HALF_OPEN / CLOSED)
   ↓
If OPEN → Exit with "system unavailable"
[Incoming Request]
   ↓
Intent + Complexity Classification
   ↓
IF intent = simple (chitchat/faq/classification)
      → Skip heavy persona layers
      → Skip memory retrieval
      → Route to cheap provider
      → Generate response
      → Log interaction
      → Early exit if high confidence
      → (Optional) enqueue learning sample
      → Return response
ELSE
      → Continue
